/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a neon-lit hexagonal grid, 2 to 8 players clash in intense matches. Capture tiles, generate mana, cast your spells, and prevent your enemies from doing the same. Easy to learn. Harder to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The battlefield is a weapon.</strong> Tiles you control deal damage to enemies who step onto them. The more territory you claim, the more mana you gain—and the more dangerous you become. But your enemies see it too. Every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_im