tps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>**</strong>7 abilities to turn the tide :<strong>**</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>**Bump**</strong> — Knock your enemy away</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/ea42b6e433cf9d055ccb425f252828a0.poster.avif?t=1780678876\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/ea42b6e433cf9d055ccb425f252828a0.webm?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/ea42b6e433cf9d055ccb425f252828a0.mp4?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>**Wave**</strong> — A devastating wave</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/9a012dd02c49fd3b9c4cde16f363753b.poster.avif?t=1780678876\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/9a012dd02c49fd3b9c4cde16f363753b.webm?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/9a012dd02c49fd3b9c4cde16f363753b.mp4?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>**Punch**</strong> — A brutal direct hit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/1cddfc38fb323158ee66695d9c289d23.poster.avif?t=1780678876\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/1cddfc38fb323158ee66695d9c289d23.webm?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/1cddfc38fb323158ee66695d9c289d23.mp4?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>**Bomb**</strong> — A delayed explosion, perfect for claiming territory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/a32fc9e82b270da960daf401a61aa171.poster.avif?t=1780678876\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/a32fc9e82b270da960daf401a61aa171.webm?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/a32fc9e82b270da960daf401a61aa171.mp4?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>**Mine**</strong> — Invisible, sneaky, non-lethal, stuns the enemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/09855dc43a72c117f5ff3f707c5bb2a8.poster.avif?t=1780678876\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/09855dc43a72c117f5ff3f707c5bb2a8.webm?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/09855dc43a72c117f5ff3f707c5bb2a8.mp4?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>**Dash**</strong> — Pure mobility to escape or strike unexpectedly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/1af551df959bbbb6a9dfef7efa0c5aba.poster.avif?t=1780678876\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/1af551df959bbbb6a9dfef7efa0c5aba.webm?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/1af551df959bbbb6a9dfef7efa0c5aba.mp4?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>**Turret**</strong> — Place a turret on one of your tiles to increase the damage of adjacent ones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/0dc327101e780b054ed9b83a493567cc.poster.avif?t=1780678876\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/0dc327101e780b054ed9b83a493567cc.webm?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/0dc327101e780b054ed9b83a493567cc.mp4?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**</strong>Death is not the end<strong>.**</strong> For 10 seconds, you become a ghost: invisible, invulnerable, untouchable. Just enough time to catch your breath…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/ee0ce8e3aea7d4c360650dd1f057f67c.poster.avif?t=1780678876\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/ee0ce8e3aea7d4c360650dd1f057f67c.webm?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/ee0ce8e3aea7d4c360650dd1f057f67c.mp4?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A competitive multiplayer territory conquest game where quick thinking matters just as much as strategy.  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\