/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a neon-lit hexagonal grid, 2 to 8 players clash in intense matches. Capture tiles, generate mana, cast your spells, and prevent your enemies from doing the same. Easy to learn. Harder to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The battlefield is a weapon.</strong> Tiles you control deal damage to enemies who step onto them. The more territory you claim, the more mana you gain—and the more dangerous you become. But your enemies see it too. Every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/62537315ad9d5f24ab3aae3c901ec1dc.webp?t=1780678876\" width=55 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>**</strong>7 abilities to turn the tide :<strong>**</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>**Bump**</strong> — Knock your enemy away</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/ea42b6e433cf9d055ccb425f252828a0.poster.avif?t=1780678876\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/ea42b6e433cf9d055ccb425f252828a0.webm?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/ea42b6e433cf9d055ccb425f252828a0.mp4?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>**Wave**</strong> — A devastating wave</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/9a012dd02c49fd3b9c4cde16f363753b.poster.avif?t=1780678876\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/9a012dd02c49fd3b9c4cde16f363753b.webm?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/9a012dd02c49fd3b9c4cde16f363753b.mp4?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>**Punch**</strong> — A brutal direct hit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/1cddfc38fb323158ee66695d9c289d23.poster.avif?t=1780678876\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/1cddfc38fb323158ee66695d9c289d23.webm?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/1cddfc38fb323158ee66695d9c289d23.mp4?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>**Bomb**</strong> — A delayed explosion, perfect for claiming territory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/a32fc9e82b270da960daf401a61aa171.poster.avif?t=1780678876\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/a32fc9e82b270da960daf401a61aa171.webm?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/a32fc9e82b270da960daf401a61aa171.mp4?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>**Mine**</strong> — Invisible, sneaky, non-lethal, stuns the enemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/09855dc43a72c117f5ff3f707c5bb2a8.poster.avif?t=1780678876\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/09855dc43a72c117f5ff3f707c5bb2a8.webm?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/09855dc43a72c117f5ff3f707c5bb2a8.mp4?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>**Dash**</strong> — Pure mobility to escape or strike unexpectedly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/1af551df959bbbb6a9dfef7efa0c5aba.poster.avif?t=1780678876\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/1af551df959bbbb6a9dfef7efa0c5aba.webm?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/1af551df959bbbb6a9dfef7efa0c5aba.mp4?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>**Turret**</strong> — Place a turret on one of your tiles to increase the damage of adjacent ones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/0dc327101e780b054ed9b83a493567cc.poster.avif?t=1780678876\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/0dc327101e780b054ed9b83a493567cc.webm?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/0dc327101e780b054ed9b83a493567cc.mp4?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**</strong>Death is not the end<strong>.**</strong> For 10 seconds, you become a ghost: invisible, invulnerable, untouchable. Just enough time to catch your breath…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/ee0ce8e3aea7d4c360650dd1f057f67c.poster.avif?t=1780678876\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/ee0ce8e3aea7d4c360650dd1f057f67c.webm?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/extras/ee0ce8e3aea7d4c360650dd1f057f67c.mp4?t=1780678876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>", "short_description": "Conquer. Control. Dominate. A fast-paced, competitive territory game where every tile you claim brings you closer to victory, and every second of inattention can turn the tide completely.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Arabic, Hindi<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/51d1cb88c49630bcc51a893d2f557b76aa82fb60/header.jpg?t=1780678876", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/c72a29fab0528518fe1e14f9b5ef4e8235dd8480/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780678876", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615870/c72a29fab0528518fe1e14f9b5ef4e8235dd8480/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780678876", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windo